WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.870
<v Guide>A world can begin with just a few words.

2
00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:11.086
<v Keeper>The beacon is still burning.

3
00:00:11.436 --> 00:00:12.866
<v Keeper>Follow it toward shore.

4
00:00:14.015 --> 00:00:16.485
<v Guide>Then someone answers from across the water.

5
00:00:17.498 --> 00:00:18.508
<v Traveler>I see it now.

6
00:00:18.758 --> 00:00:19.788
<v Traveler>Keep the light on.

7
00:00:20.838 --> 00:00:22.866
<v Guide>Give their conversation a shoreline.

8
00:00:22.906 --> 00:00:29.806
[Ocean waves]

9
00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:32.856
<v Guide>A character can return without losing their voice.

10
00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:37.446
<v Keeper (clone)>I'll keep it burning until you're home.

11
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.558
[A new music take: cello and strings]

12
00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:48.058
[The kept theme: cello and strings]

13
00:00:50.522 --> 00:00:54.352
<v Guide>Place every line where it belongs, and let the sea sit underneath.

14
00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:59.557
<v Guide>A voice... an answer... the sound of the sea.

15
00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:01.337
<v Guide>Together, they become a scene.

16
00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.570
[Ocean waves and music under the scene]

17
00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:05.540
<v Keeper>The beacon is still burning.

18
00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:07.320
<v Keeper>Follow it toward shore.

19
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.910
<v Traveler>I see it now.

20
00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.190
<v Traveler>Keep the light on.

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.810
<v Keeper (clone)>I'll keep it burning until you're home.

22
00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:20.740
<v Brand narrator>Sonic Rift.

23
00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:23.120
<v Brand narrator>Make worlds you can hear.

